  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "TerrainBehaviour is the core service managing the state, rendering, and interaction logic for a terrain surface. It orchestrates the TerrainGrid, handling procedural generation, heightmap/splat map modification, and rendering via TerrainChunkRenderer. It provides world-space query methods like raycast and heightAt, and manages editing history using TerrainHistory for sculpting and painting operations."
  },
